## Sample incident report output

```
INCIDENT DETECTED — 14:23:15 UTC
Severity: Critical

Root Cause:
  Core-SW-01 — Interface Ethernet2 went down at 14:23:01

Cascade:
  14:23:01  Core-SW-01       Ethernet2 down
  14:23:11  Dist-SW-01       OSPF neighbor 10.100.252.1 lost
  14:23:11  Dist-SW-02       OSPF neighbor 10.100.252.1 lost
  14:23:12  Dist-SW-01       Route 10.10.10.0/24 withdrawn
  14:23:14  App-Server-01    Unreachable

Impact:
  Devices affected: 4
  Estimated users offline: 120
  Estimated revenue impact: $33,600 (6 minutes × $5,600/min)

Recommended action:
  Check Core-SW-01 Ethernet2 — physical layer or config issue likely.
  Run: show interfaces Ethernet2 on Core-SW-01
```

